all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.200 --> 00:37.267
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.333 --> 00:39.400
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.467 --> 00:40.733
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.800 --> 00:42.600
SquarePants!
方裤！

