01:04.667 --> 01:09.067
* *
**
**
**

01:09.133 --> 01:10.467
- Ah.
- 啊。

01:10.533 --> 01:13.833
- Make it stop!
Ah!
- 让它停止！
啊!

01:14.933 --> 01:18.067
Ooh.
哦。

01:21.133 --> 01:23.133
Mister Squidward!
章鱼哥先生！

01:23.200 --> 01:25.333
Quit that calamitous cacophony!
停止那些灾难性的刺耳声音！

01:25.400 --> 01:27.800
You're driving me customers
batty!
你在为我带来顾客
巴蒂！

01:32.567 --> 01:36.100
- Well, I'm sorry you rubes
can't enjoy jazz.
- 好吧，我很抱歉你们这些乡巴佬
无法享受爵士乐。

01:36.167 --> 01:38.800
I am practicing for
a very important
我正在练习
一个非常重要的

01:38.867 --> 01:40.467
open mic night tonight.
今晚开放麦克风之夜。

01:40.533 --> 01:43.067
- Well,
practice somewhere else.
- 嗯，
去别的地方练习。

01:43.100 --> 01:46.667
This here's a jazz-free zone.
这是一个没有爵士乐的区域。

01:50.367 --> 01:52.467
Fine!
美好的！

01:52.533 --> 01:57.300
I'll take my music
to the people then.
我会带着我的音乐
到那时的人们。

01:57.367 --> 01:59.667
- And if I see
that clarinet again,
- 如果我看到
又是那个单簧管，

01:59.733 --> 02:03.933
it'll be going into the
woodwind chipper, you hear me?
它将进入
木管乐器削片机，你听到了吗？

02:05.067 --> 02:06.767
- As you can see,
- 如你看到的，

02:06.833 --> 02:11.400
this is a first generation
Talking Suburban Dad figurine,
这是第一代
会说话的郊区爸爸雕像，

02:11.467 --> 02:13.867
with realistic
burger-flipping motion.
与现实的
翻转汉堡的动作。

02:13.933 --> 02:18.067
- Not right now, Billy.
Daddy's had a long day.
- 现在不行，比利。
爸爸度过了漫长的一天。

02:18.133 --> 02:19.333
All: Ooh.
全体：哦。

02:21.333 --> 02:23.067
- Suburban Dad!
- 郊区的爸爸！

02:23.100 --> 02:25.067
No!
不！

02:26.833 --> 02:28.600
You?
你？

02:34.667 --> 02:38.433
- You--will remove
that subpar woodwind
- 你--将删除
那个低于标准的木管乐器

02:38.500 --> 02:42.967
from the premises,
ere I snap its reed.
从该处所，
在我折断它的簧片之前。

02:50.667 --> 02:53.067
Can't practice anywhere
in this town.
无法到处练习
在这个小镇。

02:53.067 --> 02:55.200
Bunch of tasteless clowns!
一群无味的小丑！

02:57.100 --> 02:59.067
- Smashy, smashy.
Bang, bang!
- 粉碎，粉碎。
砰，砰！

02:59.100 --> 03:01.967
Sma--oh!
Ow!
斯玛——哦！
噢！

03:02.067 --> 03:04.300
What is that noise?
那是什么噪音？

03:06.100 --> 03:07.633
Oh, no.
哦，不。

03:07.700 --> 03:09.333
Squidward's being attacked
by that
Squidward's being attacked
以此

03:09.400 --> 03:11.833
pointy screeching monster.
尖尖的尖叫怪物。

03:11.900 --> 03:14.900
Don't worry, Squidward!
I'll save you!
别担心，章鱼哥！
我来救你！

03:14.967 --> 03:17.433
- What are you--
- 你是做什么的 -

03:18.100 --> 03:21.233
Hm Hm?
嗯嗯？

03:21.300 --> 03:23.133
Oh.
哦。

03:23.200 --> 03:24.900
- You're welcome.
- 不客气。

03:29.133 --> 03:31.733
It's time for our
pre-performance nap.
是时候我们的
演出前小睡。

03:31.800 --> 03:35.933
Tonight, we change lives
with our music.
今晚，我们改变生活
和我们的音乐。

03:40.267 --> 03:42.133
- One nap later...
- 睡一觉后...

03:44.067 --> 03:45.767
We've got the--
我们有——

03:50.467 --> 03:52.133
And that's how it began.
事情就是这样开始的。

03:52.200 --> 03:53.900
My life smashed to bits.
我的生活支离破碎。

03:53.967 --> 03:56.700
My living room
covered in broken dreams.
我的客厅
被破碎的梦想所覆盖。

03:56.767 --> 03:59.567
Without my clarinet,
the world was a drab
没有我的单簧管，
世界是单调的

03:59.633 --> 04:01.300
and colorless place.
和无色的地方。

04:03.100 --> 04:05.900
- And that's when I saw him,
my first suspect.
- 就在那时我看到了他
我的第一个嫌疑人。

04:05.967 --> 04:08.533
When it came to
paying the stupid bill,
当谈到
支付愚蠢的账单，

04:08.600 --> 04:11.267
SpongeBob always tipped 20%.
海绵宝宝总是给20%的小费。

04:11.333 --> 04:13.667
He had to be involved.
他必须参与其中。

04:14.933 --> 04:17.833
SpongeBob, what have you done
with my clarinet?
海绵宝宝，你做了什么
用我的单簧管？

04:17.900 --> 04:21.400
- Ooh, Squidward,
you're so hard-boiled.
- 哦，章鱼哥，
你真是冷酷无情。

04:21.467 --> 04:22.433
Are you playing a game?
你在玩游戏吗？

04:22.500 --> 04:23.700
Oh, oh, can I play?
哦哦，我可以玩吗？

04:23.767 --> 04:26.300
- I know you stole my clarinet!
- 我知道你偷了我的单簧管！

04:26.367 --> 04:30.400
Tell me where!
It! Is!
告诉我在哪里！
它！是！

04:30.467 --> 04:33.633
- I! Don't! Know!
- 我！不！知道！

04:33.700 --> 04:36.600
It couldn't have been me,
Squidward. I have an alibi.
这不可能是我，
章鱼哥。我有不在场证明。

04:36.667 --> 04:38.367
I was at Grandma's
house all day
我在奶奶家
整天呆在家里

04:38.433 --> 04:41.367
and I have the kissy marks
to prove it, see?
我有吻痕
来证明这一点，明白吗？

04:41.433 --> 04:43.767
There's room for one more.
还有空间可以再住一个。

04:44.967 --> 04:46.467
- His alibi was solid.
- 他的不在场证明是可靠的。

04:46.533 --> 04:47.967
Only a family member
could stomach
只有一个家庭成员
可以忍受

04:48.067 --> 04:50.133
putting their lips
on this fool.
把他们的嘴唇
在这个傻瓜身上。

04:50.200 --> 04:51.633
- You know, we have
lots of friends.
- 你知道，我们有
很多朋友。

04:51.700 --> 04:53.433
Maybe they could help us
find your clarinet.
也许他们可以帮助我们
找到你的单簧管。

04:53.500 --> 04:56.433
- I don't have friends.
I have suspects.
- 我没有朋友。
我有嫌疑人。

04:56.500 --> 04:58.300
- Oh, Squidward, don't you know
-哦，章鱼哥，你不知道吗

04:58.367 --> 05:01.933
a suspect is just a friend you
haven't cleared of charges yet?
嫌疑人只是你的朋友
还没有结清罪名吗？

05:04.500 --> 05:07.300
So... can I help you
solve your case?
那么...我可以帮你吗
解决你的案子吗？

05:07.367 --> 05:09.400
Please, please, please?
拜托，拜托，拜托？

05:09.467 --> 05:11.067
- Try not to get in the way.
- 尽量不要妨碍。

05:11.100 --> 05:13.833
- Yeah!
It's a play-date!
- 是的！
这是一个玩耍约会！

05:13.900 --> 05:15.433
I mean...
我是说...

05:15.500 --> 05:17.267
All right, I'll partner up
with you this time.
好的，我来搭档
这次和你在一起。

05:19.300 --> 05:21.067
Huh?
啊？

05:25.100 --> 05:27.067
partner and I
我和合伙人

05:27.067 --> 05:29.500
decided to check out
my next suspect,
决定去看看
我的下一个嫌疑人

05:29.567 --> 05:31.667
the owner of
a local greasy spoon.
的所有者
当地的油腻勺子。

05:31.733 --> 05:34.367
I figured a little
"Good cop, bad cop"
我想到了一点
“好警察，坏警察”

05:34.433 --> 05:36.300
would get his jaw flapping
so I--
会让他的下巴拍打
所以我——

05:36.367 --> 05:39.333
Please, please, can I, please?
拜托，拜托，我可以吗？

05:39.400 --> 05:42.933
- Yes, if you get out of
my hard-boiled narration!
- 是的，如果你离开
我的冷酷叙述！

05:43.067 --> 05:45.200
- Sorry.
- 对不起。

05:45.267 --> 05:48.200
* *
**
**
**

05:57.067 --> 05:58.667
What the--
什么是——

05:58.733 --> 06:01.700
- Hey, Mister Krabs,
how you doing?
- 嘿，螃蟹先生，
你好吗？

06:01.767 --> 06:03.600
Can I get you some tea?
我可以给你倒杯茶吗？

06:03.667 --> 06:06.767
Do you mind if I ask you
a few questions?
你介意我问你吗
有几个问题？

06:06.833 --> 06:09.067
Now, where were you earlier--
现在，你刚才在哪里——

06:09.067 --> 06:11.433
- You seem hungry, dear.
Home
- 亲爱的，你看起来很饿。
家

06:12.800 --> 06:15.267
- What are you doing,
SpongeBob?
- 你在做什么，
海绵宝宝？

06:15.333 --> 06:16.933
Manicure?
美甲？

06:30.367 --> 06:31.400
- Hey!
- 嘿！

06:31.467 --> 06:33.300
Enough!
足够的！

06:33.367 --> 06:35.100
- Hey, check out the dame.
- 嘿，看看这位女士。

06:38.500 --> 06:40.233
- What in the salty seven seas
- 咸咸的七大洋里有什么

06:40.300 --> 06:41.833
are you two doing?
你们两个在做什么？

06:41.900 --> 06:44.200
- Oh, uh, we're playing
"Good cop, good cop."
- 哦，呃，我们正在玩
“好警察，好警察。”

06:44.267 --> 06:46.767
Sorry, Squidward, I don't know
how to be the bad cop!
对不起，章鱼哥，我不知道
如何成为坏警察！

06:46.833 --> 06:49.133
- We're looking for my
clarinet, Eugene.
- 我们正在寻找我的
单簧管，尤金。

06:49.200 --> 06:52.200
I know you broke into
my house this afternoon!
我知道你闯入了
今天下午我家！

06:52.267 --> 06:55.533
I know you stole it!
Now fess up!
我知道是你偷的！
现在坦白吧！

06:55.600 --> 06:57.933
Well, I was--
嗯，我当时——

06:58.067 --> 07:00.467
I've been here all day,
counting me money.
我已经在这里一整天了
数我钱。

07:00.533 --> 07:03.767
Just look at me butt groove.
看看我的屁股沟。

07:03.833 --> 07:06.200
- Good contours.
And still warm.
- 良好的轮廓。
而且还是温暖的。

07:06.267 --> 07:09.067
Story checks out.
故事结束了。

07:09.100 --> 07:12.300
- All right, Krabs,
we'll mosey along
- 好吧，蟹蟹们，
我们会一起走

07:12.367 --> 07:14.367
this time.
这次。

07:14.433 --> 07:16.067
Come on, SpongeBob.
来吧，海绵宝宝。

07:16.133 --> 07:18.267
- Mm, mmm.
- 嗯，嗯。

07:18.333 --> 07:22.200
- Boys, if you two do
find that clarinet,
- 孩子们，如果你们两个这样做的话
找到那个单簧管，

07:22.267 --> 07:23.500
could you bring it to me?
你能把它带给我吗？

07:23.567 --> 07:26.067
So I can smash it to pieces!
这样我就可以把它撕成碎片了！

07:26.100 --> 07:28.833
- We pulled up
to the local dweeb market,
- 我们停下来
前往当地的 Dweeb 市场，

07:28.900 --> 07:31.233
where I hoped to find
my next suspect:
我希望找到的地方
我的下一个嫌疑人：

07:31.300 --> 07:35.433
maven of all things moronic,
Bubby Bass.
一切白痴事物的专家，
巴比·巴斯.

07:35.500 --> 07:37.100
The sign said closed,
牌子上写着关门，

07:37.167 --> 07:40.067
but I could hear their
nerdy murmuring inside.
但我能听到他们的声音
书呆子内心嘀咕着。

07:40.100 --> 07:43.667
- And then, from
the depths of the barbeque,
- 然后，从
烧烤的深处，

07:43.733 --> 07:47.167
comes the ferocious,
fire-breathing
凶猛的来了，
喷火

07:47.233 --> 07:50.100
Dad!
爸爸！

07:51.233 --> 07:52.733
Bubble Bass!
泡泡贝斯！

07:52.800 --> 07:53.967
Ow!
噢！

07:55.233 --> 07:56.300
- Squidward, wait!
- 章鱼哥，等等！

07:56.367 --> 07:57.600
Let him handle this.
这事就让他来处理吧。

08:03.400 --> 08:10.633
* *
**
**
**

08:11.533 --> 08:13.533
- Take that!
And that!
- 拿着那个！
还有那个！

08:20.133 --> 08:21.167
All right.
好的。

08:21.233 --> 08:22.567
You've got me cornered.
你已经把我逼到墙角了。

08:22.633 --> 08:24.633
But I won't give up
without a fight!
但我不会放弃
不战而屈人之兵！

08:24.700 --> 08:26.233
- I was hoping you'd say that.
- 我本来希望你会这么说。

08:26.300 --> 08:29.433
- It was a real knockdown,
drag-out fight.
- 这是一次真正的击倒，
拖拖拉拉的战斗。

08:29.500 --> 08:31.367
Or it would have been,
if it hadn't been
或者它会是，
如果不是的话

08:31.433 --> 08:35.567
just two sad adults
playing with toys.
只是两个悲伤的成年人
玩玩具。

08:35.633 --> 08:37.167
- Wait.
Wait!
- 等待。
等待！

08:37.233 --> 08:40.633
Roll the dice.
Did his punch land?
掷骰子。
他的拳头落地了吗？

08:42.567 --> 08:44.067
- It's a hit!
- 很受欢迎！

08:46.333 --> 08:47.267
Huh?
啊？

08:47.333 --> 08:48.533
Oh.
哦。

08:48.600 --> 08:50.167
- Where were you
this afternoon?
- 你在哪里
今天下午？

08:50.233 --> 08:51.700
Where's Squidward's clarinet?
章鱼哥的单簧管在哪里？

08:51.767 --> 08:53.167
- I don't know what
you're talking about.
- 我不知道什么
你说的是。

08:53.233 --> 08:56.167
I was here all day.
I swear it!
我一整天都在这里。
我发誓！

09:00.367 --> 09:03.067
- Billy, don't make me
turn this boat around.
- 比利，别逼我
把这艘船调转过来。

09:03.100 --> 09:08.500
- No! I still could have
passed you off as near mint!
- 不！我仍然可以拥有
把你当成近乎完美的人了！

09:11.933 --> 09:13.433
- So, sorry, man.
- Aww.
- 所以，对不起，伙计。
- 哇。

09:13.500 --> 09:15.633
- I am so sorry for your loss.
- 我对你的损失感到非常抱歉。

09:15.700 --> 09:17.700
- I'm not.
Come on, SpongeBob, let's go.
- 我不是。
来吧，海绵宝宝，我们走吧。

09:17.767 --> 09:19.167
This is a dead end.
这是一个死胡同。

09:20.633 --> 09:22.800
* *
**
**
**

09:22.867 --> 09:26.833
Well, there's only one person
left on my list of suspects.
还好只有一个人
留在我的嫌疑人名单上。

09:33.700 --> 09:35.300
Hey, guys.
嘿，伙计们。

09:35.367 --> 09:39.867
- Well, the criminal returns
to the scene of the crime.
- 好吧，罪犯回来了
到犯罪现场。

09:39.933 --> 09:42.800
Spill the beans, Jack!
Where's my clarinet?
泄露秘密，杰克！
我的单簧管在哪里？

09:42.867 --> 09:44.700
- I don't know who Jack is!
- 我不知道杰克是谁！

09:44.767 --> 09:46.867
But I would like some beans!
但我想要一些豆子！

09:46.933 --> 09:48.600
- Let me lay it out for you,
Chucko.
- 让我为你列出来，
查克。

09:48.667 --> 09:51.700
When I took my nap today, you
broke in through the window,
今天我午睡的时候，你
破窗而入，

09:51.767 --> 09:55.467
smashed my living room, got
that goo you're eating all over
砸坏了我的客厅，得到了
你吃得到处都是的东西

09:55.533 --> 09:58.133
and stole my clarinet!
还偷了我的单簧管！

09:58.200 --> 10:00.467
- Oh, this isn't goo.
- 哦，这不太好。

10:00.533 --> 10:01.967
It's jelly!
是果冻！

10:02.033 --> 10:05.200
The good stuff too,
from real jellyfish.
好东西也有，
来自真正的水母。

10:12.033 --> 10:13.400
You can only find
that in one place.
你只能找到
那个在一个地方。

10:13.467 --> 10:14.700
That means our thief...
这意味着我们的小偷...

10:14.767 --> 10:16.500
- Must have been
at Jellyfish Fields.
- 一定是
在水母田。

10:16.567 --> 10:19.167
Let's go.
- Right behind you, pal.
我们走吧。
- 就在你身后，朋友。

10:19.233 --> 10:20.500
Huh?
啊？

10:20.567 --> 10:22.333
Whoa!
哇！

10:24.933 --> 10:27.233
- When we arrived
at Jellyfish Fields,
- 当我们到达时
在水母田，

10:27.300 --> 10:31.633
I could already hear
my clarinet's dulcet tones.
我已经能听到
我的单簧管悦耳的音色。

10:31.700 --> 10:33.767
* *
**
**
**

10:38.067 --> 10:40.033
- My baby!
- 我的宝贝！

10:42.333 --> 10:44.233
Ha!
哈!

10:44.300 --> 10:48.333
- Oh! So it was the jellyfish
that took your clarinet.
- 哦！所以这是水母
那拿走了你的单簧管。

10:48.400 --> 10:49.800
But from the sound of it,
但从声音来看，

10:49.867 --> 10:53.067
I'd say they learned that
crime doesn't play!
我想说他们学到了这一点
犯罪不玩！

10:56.433 --> 10:57.667
- Look, Squidward.
- 看，章鱼哥。

10:57.733 --> 10:59.633
The jellyfish are fans
of your music.
水母是粉丝
你的音乐。

10:59.700 --> 11:02.767
- We should solve
another mystery now.
- 我们应该解决
现在又是一个谜了。

11:02.833 --> 11:04.600
- Yeah, uh,
how about the mystery
- 是的，呃，
谜底又如何

11:04.667 --> 11:06.267
of where all my coins went?
我所有的硬币都去哪儿了？

11:06.333 --> 11:07.900
Huh?
啊？

11:09.200 --> 11:11.700
- Solved!
- 解决了！

11:14.767 --> 11:16.333
